{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/11.png?t=1744881149\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/666.gif?t=1744881149\" /><br>You have damaged your ship and ended up on a planet where the air is unsuitable for breathing. But all is not lost! You will have to use all your skills and intelligence to survive and return to Earth.<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/12.png?t=1744881149\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/base.gif?t=1744881149\" /><br>Start with the basics \u2014 create a base that will be your refuge on this hostile planet. Develop a strategy to protect and develop your base.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/24.png?t=1744881149\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/resurs.gif?t=1744881149\" /><br>Resources are your everything on this planet. Get them, manage them wisely and use them to terraform the planet and grow food.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/14.png?t=1744881149\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/terra.gif?t=1744881149\" /><br>Turn a disastrous landscape into a picturesque paradise! Explore the environment, interact with the ecosystem of the planet and try to transform it into a green and picturesque area.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/10.png?t=1744881149\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/vrag.gif?t=1744881149\" /><br>Besides the fact that you have to fight a hostile environment, there are dangers and secrets hiding on the planet. Solve the puzzles and face the threats to survive.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/15.png?t=1744881149\" /><br>There are no grocery stores on this planet. You will have to grow your own food and take care of your diet to avoid starvation.<br><br><br><br>Build your base from scratch, discover new technologies, grow food and create unique ecosystems. Can you turn this inhospitable planet into a thriving place to live?<br>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664250?t=1744881149","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/4b53e9259a0ce9bcb04f41e44580799bf0614c1e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744881149","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/534c135fc3c3a70b1fe91c403ff1da24993e6250/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744881149","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/534c135fc3c3a70b1fe91c403ff1da24993e6250/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744881149","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/11.png?t=1744881149\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/extras/666.gif?t=1744881149\" /><br>You have damaged your ship and ended up on a planet where the air is unsuitable for breathing. But all is not lost! You will have to use all your skills 