anet. You will have to grow your own food and take care of your diet to avoid starvation.<br><br><br><br>Build your base from scratch, discover new technologies, grow food and create unique ecosystems. Can you turn this inhospitable planet into a thriving place to live?<br>","developers":["VIVA"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664250/c0325bfeec0131ef0e2adae4e9fe0d1fbc39c43c/header.jpg?t=1744881149","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257125462,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125462/movie480.mp4?t=1744695140","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125462/movie_max.mp4?t=1744695140"},"name":"\u0413\u0435\u0439\u043c\u043f\u043b\u0435\u0439","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257125462/cb0e174931c3868dc3f417218db7bf8ec6634a40/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744695140","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125462/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744695140","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125462/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744695140"}}],"name":"AstroPlanet","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 8, 8.1, 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> X64 Dual Core CPU, 2+ \u0413\u0413\u0446<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> \u041e\u0442\u0434\u0435\u043b\u044c\u043d\u0430\u044f \u0432\u0438\u0434\u0435\u043e\u043a\u0430\u0440\u0442\u0430 \u0441 4 \u0413\u0411 \u0432\u0438\u0434\u0435\u043e\u043f\u0430\u043c\u044f\u0442\u0438<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<stron